      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define trade prices and prevailing bid/offer prices\n    transactions = [\n        {\"trade_price\": 41.50, \"bid\": 41.45, \"offer\": 41.50},\n        {\"trade_price\": 41.75, \"bid\": 41.73, \"offer\": 41.75},\n    ]\n\n    # Calculate each transaction's effective spread:\n    # Effective spread = 2 * absolute(trade price - midpoint)\n    effective_spreads = []\n    for transaction in transactions:\n        midpoint = (transaction[\"bid\"] + transaction[\"offer\"]) / 2\n        effective_spread = 2 * abs(transaction[\"trade_price\"] - midpoint)\n        effective_spreads.append(effective_spread)\n\n    # Calculate the average effective spread\n    average_effective_spread = sum(effective_spreads) / len(effective_spreads)\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(average_effective_spread, 3)\n```",
